          "to": "[ʔ]",
          "note": "In Yucatec Maya, glottalized stops /pʼ tʼ kʼ/ followed by an identical consonant optionally debuccalize to [ʔ], losing their oral place of articulation. The ejective quality is retained as a pure glottal closure."
